@startuml
' Alternative 6: lecturer-friendly simplified view.

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 0
}

rectangle "1. Facade\nSeparationService\none simple separation call" as Facade #DCEBFF
rectangle "2. Factory Method\nSeparationAlgorithmFactory\nchooses the algorithm object" as Factory #E4F7E7
rectangle "3. Strategy\nSeparationAlgorithm interface\nNeoSSNetStrategy implementation" as Strategy #FFF1CC
rectangle "Result\nheart.wav + lung.wav" as Result #F6F7F9

Facade --> Factory : asks for selected model algorithm
Factory --> Strategy : returns algorithm object
Facade --> Strategy : runs separate()
Strategy --> Result : generates files

@enduml
